## List Categories

```
GET /categories
```

Returns all available track categories/genres.

### Response

```json
{
  "data": [
    {
      "id": "uuid",
      "name": "Rock",
      "slug": "rock",
      "created_at": "2024-01-01T00:00:00Z"
    }
  ]
}
```

Categories are used to classify tracks via the `track_categories` junction table.
